message: "If you use the FireViewer AI Worker in research, please cite FireViewer and the specific models or datasets used by your experiment."
title: "FireViewer AI Worker"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Unicorn Who Dev"
    email: "unicornwhodev@gmail.com"
repository-code: "https://github.com/fireviewer/fireviewer-ai-worker"
url: "https://github.com/fireviewer/fireviewer-ai-worker"
abstract: >-
  FireViewer AI Worker provides provenance-aware wildfire evidence acquisition,
  visual and satellite processing, deterministic geographic hypotheses,
  spatio-temporal evidence assembly and structured multimodal assessment for the
  FireViewer research pipeline.
keywords:
  - wildfire
  - computer vision
  - remote sensing
  - geospatial
  - provenance
  - multimodal
  - evidence
  - reproducibility
